            "code": "\n\tsecurity \u003d value[\u0027security\u0027]\n\tcanCreate \u003d False\n\tcanEdit \u003d False\n\tcanDelete \u003d False\n\tif security[\u0027userCRUD\u0027] is not None and security[\u0027userId\u0027] is not None:\n\t\tif security[\u0027userCRUD\u0027][\u0027isGatewayAdmin\u0027] or security[\u0027userCRUD\u0027][\u0027scheduleOperations\u0027][\u0027enabled\u0027]: \n\t\t\tcanDelete \u003d True\n\t\t\tif value[\u0027params\u0027][\u0027endDate\u0027] is None: canEdit \u003d True\n\t\n\treturn {\"canCreate\": canCreate, \"canDelete\": canDelete, \"canRead\": True, \"canUpdate\": canEdit}",
            "type": "script"
          }
        ],
        "type": "expr-struct"
      },
